    "body": "Bisected the second failure (`first_router_part`), which is a different cause from #3686:\n\n- Last run where it passed: `82db54282` (only `catalog_render` failed there).\n- It already fails at `b215df411` (run locally on M5), which is the merge of #3684 (tabbed contour entry). The runs of `b215df411` and `9a4cf16f9` were cancelled, so CI never showed this commit.\n- Failing assert: `first_router_part.rs:282`, \"committed demo matches command build\". The difference is only in `2D Contour1`:\n  - In the committed `examples/first-router-part.camproj` demo, the passes at Z-4, Z-8 and Z-9 enter at X173.514 Y24.198 with an arc onto the corner.\n  - The command build enters those passes at X176 Y80.991, mid-side, the same way as the tabbed Z-12 pass.\n  - Drill, Pocket and the Z-12 pass are identical.\n- Likely fix: regenerate the committed router demo after #3684, if the new entry is intended. Otherwise #3684 changed the entry for the passes above the tabs as well.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
